# Pairs with NoWaitCycle. The split holding B's gate waits on C's capture, whose seeding waits on B's gate.
MODULE: SiblingSetterQueuedBehindCapture
TARGET: NoWaitCycle
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: SetPrevSiblingAsync queues behind C's running turn
PERTURBS: AdmitSibling

--- FIND
    /\ Admits("C", SiblingSettersInterleave)
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: SetPrevSiblingAsync is not [AlwaysInterleave]
    /\ Admits("C", FALSE)
--- END
